-- The integration queue is the only merge path (plan 3.2 stage D2b).
--
-- `run_merge` now only admits a Task to the queue of its repository's target
-- branch; the queue's own Task steps report the result. The workflow hook
-- `auto_cascade_on_merge_result` is removed: it only ever answered `Ok` or
-- `Skipped` and decided nothing.
--
-- Every Project persists its own copy of the workflow definition, and queued
-- Task steps reference retained snapshots of one. Drop the removed hook name
-- from every hook list of every state in both, keeping everything else
-- (order of states and hooks, every other key) as it is. A definition that
-- does not name the hook is not touched.

