-- A retained snapshot is the frozen pair a step was enqueued with:
-- `{"workflow": <the Task's resolved definition>, "project_workflow_definition":
-- <the Project's stored definition, as JSON text, or null>}`. Both are
-- rewritten. A snapshot is unique by its text: if the rewritten text is
-- already another snapshot's, this row keeps its old text instead of failing
-- the upgrade (a step that still references it fails its removed hook as an
-- unknown action and says so on the Task).
